\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 I have to tell you that as the parent of young children, I\u8217 m terrified \u8211  terrified at the prospect that they will encounter what seems to be an innocent little pill and that in its small size, has death written all over it.}
