\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Choices we make will have impact for thousands of years ahead. The time for excuses and baby steps are over.}{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0
